We have a history of net losses and we may not be able to achieve or sustain profitability.
We have incurred significant losses in each period since our inception in 2007. We incurred net losses of $27.6 million in 2018 and $48.7 million in
2017. As of December 31, 2018, we had an accumulated deficit of approximately $328.9 million. These losses and our accumulated deficit reflect the substantial
investments we have made to develop our Lumivascular platform and acquire customers.
